563
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:50,320
So our laboratory findings

564
00:29:50,320 --> 00:29:52,280
for iron deficiency anemia.

565
00:29:52,540 --> 00:29:55,680
Again, we're going to see
our MCV under 80 in the

566
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:59,580
later stages. This again is
