We don't want it circulating

633
00:33:24,900 --> 00:33:27,720
in the plasma because
that's where the bacteria

634
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:30,720
could potentially get it,
and the treatment is usually

635
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:32,800
